      hu: ["A botanikus kertet hivatalosan 2003-ban alapították.", "Az intézmény teljes területe körülbelül 8 hektár.", "A pálmakertben több mint 100 különböző pálmafaj található meg.", "Rendszeres erdősítési programokat szerveznek őshonos fafajok felhasználásával.", "Ez Haiti azon kevés botanikus kertjének egyike, amely nemzetközi szinten is elismert.", "Fontos kutatási helyszínként szolgál a haitiani egyetemi hallgatók számára."],
      ro: ["Grădina a fost fondată oficial în anul 2003.", "Suprafața totală a instituției este de aproximativ 8 hectare.", "Adăpostește o colecție impresionantă de peste 100 de specii de palmieri.", "Derulează programe active de reîmpădurire folosind specii de arbori nativi.", "Este una dintre puținele grădini botanice acreditate din Haiti.", "Servește ca centru de cercetare vital pentru studenții universităților locale."],
      en: ["The garden was officially established in the year 2003.", "The total area of the botanical garden is approximately 8 hectares.", "It features a significant collection of over 100 palm species in its palmetum.", "The institution runs active reforestation programs using native tree species.", "It is one of the few internationally recognized botanical gardens in Haiti.", "The garden serves as a critical research hub for Haitian university students."],
