      en: ["Jérémie was officially founded in the year 1756.", "The city is located approximately 290 kilometers west of Port-au-Prince.", "The park serves as a primary green space for over 30,000 urban residents.", "The Grand'Anse region produces the majority of Haitian cocoa.", "The nearby Massif de la Hotte reaches elevations over 2,300 meters.", "Average annual temperature in the coastal zone is 27 degrees Celsius."],
